  "description": "One MCP server for your Umbraco 17 site. Detects the installed Umbraco products so the umbrella-mcp server loads only their tools (CMS, Forms, Automate and Engage), and adds MCP health checks and an \"Umbrella\" dashboard: client config to copy for each API user, and tool groups and levels (full, no destructive tools, read-only) for all API users or per API user.",
